flowchart TB
  S["Failed live validation<br/>or eligible attributed human feedback"]
  T["Deduplicate and admit campaign<br/>One active per workspace; daily and depth limits"]
  F["Freeze baseline, sources, models and evaluator<br/>Three cases: diagnosis + two unseen synthetic variants"]
  P["Separate OpenAI proposal request<br/>Select prompt modules and retrieval order<br/>Proposer cannot see unseen cases"]
  R["Six real trials<br/>Baseline and candidate each run all three cases<br/>Same runtime, checks and repair limits"]
  G{"All promotion gates pass?"}
  A["Activate workspace champion version<br/>Atomic compare-and-swap guards concurrent changes"]
  N["Next event pins active champion<br/>Existing events retain their original version"]
  X["Reject, mark inconclusive or block<br/>Keep current champion and evidence"]
  B["Authorized rollback<br/>Restore prior version; retain history"]
  Q["Required evidence<br/>Candidate passes 3 of 3 cases<br/>More passes or fewer repairs<br/>Cost and latency each within +25%<br/>Real receipts; unchanged frozen inputs"]
  S --> T --> F --> P --> R --> G
  Q -.-> G
  G -->|"Yes"| A --> N
  G -->|"No"| X
  P -->|"No justified change / invalid proposal / block"| X
  R -->|"Uncertain charge / incomplete trials"| X
  A --> B --> N
  classDef agent fill:#eee9ff,stroke:#6551ad,color:#302451;
  classDef durable fill:#e8f4ed,stroke:#39744d,color:#214d31;
  classDef protected fill:#fff2d9,stroke:#ac751c,color:#5e3c09;
  class P,R agent;
  class A,N durable;
  class G,Q,B protected;
